    <briefdescription>
<para>Adaptive rate limiting for API connectors with backpressure support. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>Phase 2.9 (Bounded Resources + Stress Tests) — ING-IMPL-008</para>
<para>Provides:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Rate limit header parsing (RateLimit-Limit, RateLimit-Remaining, Retry-After)</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Adaptive throttling based on API responses</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Graceful degradation when rate limits are exceeded</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Per-connector rate limit tracking</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para>src/ingestion/ROADMAP.md — Phase 2.9 item </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
